          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.37.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 37:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ke Yehova yero ni Musa, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gam iri yath ma ng’wice ng’ar ma cu: kum udok ma liu ma ng’wice ng’ar cekel dak abic, man ng’et maeno mir apoka yen ma lim lim, en e cekel dak ario ku pier abic, man kum thiang’ ma lim lim cekel dak ario ku pier abic, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man kum apoka yen ma lim lim cekel dak abic, calku cekel mi kamaleng’, man mi moj yau i amorpi acel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man itime ni mo ma leng’ m’awira, gin ma ng’wice ng’ar ma jujebo ku rieko pa jabodho mi gin ma ng’wice ng’ar: ebibedo mo m’awira ma leng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man iwir hema mi cokri kudo, man sanduk mi lembatuca, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man mesa kud agulune ceke, ku thethala kud agulune ceke, man pemblam mir udok ma ng’wice ng’ar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku pemblam mi lam m’awang’a karacelo kud agulune ceke, ku jamblogo man there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man idwokgi leng’, kara gibed leng’ m’usagu: gin ceke ma tek umulogi bibedo leng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man iwir Elarun ku wote, man idwokgi leng’, kara gitim tim ira i tic ma pa jalam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man iyer ni nyithindho mir Israel, iwac kumae, Maeni bibedo mo m’awira ma leng’ ira i kind dhanum’utuk mu ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubikonje wi ring’kum mi dhanu ngo, kadok moko ma calu maeni de kud wutim, calku jambe ma ni i ie: en e leng’, man ebibedo leng’ iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atu ma tek ujebo moko calu maeni, kadi ng’atu ma tek ukonjo kume moko wi jawirok, jubikabe woko ku ba juthugi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
