              "EXO.30.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova wacu ni Musa kumae, Gam iri yath ma lim lim ma jwa jwa, en e udok ma ng’wice ng’ar, man apoka rec, kud udok ma ng’wice ng’ar ma tung’; yath ma lim lim ma jwa jwa karacelo kud udok ma ng’wice ng’ar ma leng’: pekne kubang’e kubang’e bibedo rom rom; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man itim udok ma ng’wice ng’ar kude, gin ma ng’wice ng’ar calku rieko pa jabodho, mi gin ma ng’wice ng’ar, ma juketho kadu rome, ma ie leng’ man ma leng’: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ifod kume moko thindho thindho, man ikethe i wang’ lembatuca i hema i cokri, ka ma wabirombo ie wakudi: ebibedo iwu leng’ m’usagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man udok ma ng’wice ng’ar m’ibitimo, calku jebne kud wutim iwu giwu: ebibedo leng’ iri ni Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atu ma tek bitimo calu maeno, kara eng’wiye, jubikabe woko ku ba juthugi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.38"
            ]
          }
        }
